  offerLine: I wondered, if it's not too much trouble. You go out at night, don't you? I can hear crickets, always just out of reach. Would you... find me a few?
  activeLine: Only if you're going out anyway. Crickets come out at night.
  readyLine: Oh! You really did. Nobody ever really does. I found this when I was hiding. You can sit on it, I think.
  doneLine: I can show you where they go, if you like.
